# ir_decode_emit.pith — emission of json, handle-pool, and config decode
# calls: walking a target struct's fields and generating the
# per-field fetch, convert, default, and merge sequences.
#
# the emitter's expression machinery stays in the core; where a field
# default needs an expression emitted in place, these functions take
# the emission hooks as explicit parameters (emit_expr, emit_value,
# emit_default_ret) instead of importing the core back — that keeps
# the module graph a dag.

